if you want to calculate what percentage of genomic features is covered by CpGs with methylation calls, you can just use methylRaw object, convert it to GRanges with as(...,"GRanges"). Then you can use GenomicRanges::findOverlaps or something similar to figure out what percentage of features are covered.

Best,
Altuna

